  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <h1>Best CRM for Small Business in 2026</h1>
      <div class="meta">Updated July 2026 · Ranked 5 CRMs · Business Tools Pillar · Small Business Category</div>

      <p>A CRM (Customer Relationship Management) tool is the system of record for every prospect, lead, and customer your small business interacts with. The right CRM prevents lost deals, automates follow-up, and gives you a pipeline forecast you can trust. The wrong CRM becomes a $50/month spreadsheet that your sales team refuses to use. We ranked HubSpot, Pipedrive, Zoho CRM, Freshsales, and Monday Sales CRM on the criteria that matter most to small businesses: free tier quality, per-user pricing, ease of adoption, automation, and growth headroom.</p>
      <p>For head-to-head breakdowns, see <a href="/reviews/hubspot-vs-salesforce/">HubSpot vs Salesforce</a>. Explore the <a href="/reviews/business-tools/">Business Tools Pillar Hub</a> for email marketing, accounting, and project management reviews.</p>

      <nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
        <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-overall-hubspot">#1 — HubSpot CRM (Best Overall for Small Business)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-sales-pipedrive">#2 — Pipedrive (Best for Sales-Focused Teams)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-value-zoho">#3 — Zoho CRM (Best Value & Feature Depth)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-ai-freshsales">#4 — Freshsales (Best for AI-Powered Insights)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#best-visual-monday">#5 — Monday Sales CRM (Best for Visual Pipelines)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#selection-scenarios">Selection Scenarios</a></li>
          <li><a href="#buying-guide">How to Choose</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <h2 id="quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>CRM</th>
            <th>Best For</th>
            <th>Starting Price</th>
            <th>Free Tier</th>
            <th>Rating</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>HubSpot CRM</strong></td>
